---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Zcompressor vs Adobe Acrobat Online - Free Adobe Alternative | Compress PDF"
  description="Zcompressor aur Adobe Acrobat Online ka comparison. Janiye kyu Zcompressor bina account banaye aur bina server upload ke browser me PDF compress karne ka best alternative hai."
  ogUrl="https://zcompressor.com/hi/vs/adobe-acrobat"
>
  <!-- JSON-LD FAQ Schema in Hinglish -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Adobe Acrobat Online ke comparison me Zcompressor kaisa hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Adobe Acrobat Online par file upload karni padti hai aur ek bar use karne ke baad hi account login wall aa jaata hai. Zcompressor 100% free hai, browser me hi local process karta hai aur koi account ya registration nahi mangta.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor ke liye koi software install karna padta hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Nahi. Zcompressor direct aapke web browser (Chrome, Edge, Safari, Firefox) me chalta hai bina kisi desktop software ya extension ko download kiye.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <Header />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas-soft text-ink py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Eyebrow & Title -->
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span
          class="text-caption-mono font-mono text-link-deep dark:text-cyan-deep uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3 animate-fade-in"
        >
          Compliance Review
        </span>
        <h1
          class="text-display-lg md:text-display-xl text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] md:tracking-[-2.4px] mb-4"
        >
          Zcompressor vs Adobe Acrobat.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body text-balance">
          Bina kisi heavy software install kiye aur bina Adobe account banaye instant in-browser compression.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Overview Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6 mb-12">
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          Adobe Acrobat PDF standard ka creator hai, lekin unke online tools me sabse badi samasya "Sign-in to Download" aur cloud upload ki hoti hai. Ek single file compress karne ke baad hi user se Adobe ID login mangi jaati hai.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          Zcompressor aapko desktop software jaisi privacy deta hai bina kisi registration ya app download ke.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Side-by-Side Comparison Table -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-6">
          Feature Comparison.
        </h2>
        <div class="border border-hairline rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-level-2 bg-canvas">
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Feature</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-ink font-semibold uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Zcompressor</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Adobe Acrobat Online</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Account Required</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Nahi (No Sign-in Wall)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Haan (Compulsory Sign-in)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Cloud Upload</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">0% (Pure Client-Side)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Adobe Document Cloud par Upload</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Pricing</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">100% Free Forever</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Paid Subscription (Acrobat Pro)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Target Size Selection</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">100KB, 200KB, 300KB, etc.</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Sirf High/Medium/Low</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <section class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold mb-6">Bina sign-in ke turant PDF compress karein.</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/hi/compress-pdf"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-primary text-on-primary text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-black transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-3 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Compress Shuru Karein
          </a>
          <a
            href="/hi/vs"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-canvas text-ink border border-hairline text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-canvas-soft transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-2 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Sabhi Comparisons Dekhein
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
